# Measured against this engine (Docker 29.7.2, BuildKit) while closing audit M10f: a pattern
# here matches from the context root and `*` does not cross `/`, so `.env` excludes only the
# top-level file - a nested `src/.env` was copied into the image regardless. Secret- and
# build-bearing patterns are therefore written twice, once bare and once with `**/`. Do not
# delete the `**/` lines as duplicates.
#
# `public/` must stay in the context: nginx serves the self-hosted Monaco tree from
# `public/monaco/vs` (`audit M7`), and the CSP in nginx.conf only holds because Monaco is
# same-origin.
node_modules
dist
build
coverage
.git
npm-debug.log*
*.log
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/*.log

# Environment files and keys
.env
.env.*
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.*
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Editor and OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
